## Interface: 120100
## ExcludeLoadGameType: forever
## Title: Lunchbox Toolkit — Rogue
## IconTexture: Interface\AddOns\LunchboxToolkit\Media\Inv_treasurechest_felfirecitadel_64
## Notes: Adds main-hand and off-hand poison reminders for Rogues to the Lunchbox Toolkit buff monitor. Two separate switches (rogueMainHandPoison, rogueOffHandPoison), both off by default and per character; the off-hand reminder is unavailable with no off-hand weapon. A temporary enhancement cannot be told apart from a sharpening stone or oil, and poison damage is not scored.
## Author: Lunchbox
## Version: 1.0.0
## Dependencies: LunchboxToolkit

Rogue.lua
